# WoW CVars applied before launch in couch mode (name value)
renderScale 0.5
ResampleQuality 3
vsync 1
maxFPS 60
GxMaximize 1
GamePadEnable 1
SoftTargetEnemy 1
SoftTargetInteract 1
# Sound (2026-11-14): always on, System Default device (= the TV sink set by `audio wow start`),
# and keep playing when the window loses focus (XWayland/OSK/notifications must not mute it)
Sound_EnableAllSound 1
Sound_OutputDriverIndex 0
Sound_OutputDriverName System Default
Sound_EnableSoundWhenGameIsInBG 1
